  {
    "id": "idis",
    "name": "IDIS",
    "defaultPort": 554,
    "channel": true,
    "entries": [
      {
        "main": "/trackID=1",
        "sub": "/trackID=2",
        "third": null,
        "port": null,
        "note": "Cameras. Official wording: camera rtsp://ID:password@IP:RTSP port/trackID='Stream number'; NVR/TVR rtsp://.../trackID=<camera-number>&streamID=<stream-number>; default port 554. The FAQ does not say which number is the main stream (1 = main, 2 = sub has no official basis). The YouTube example in the same FAQ uses trackID=1.",
        "source": "https://www.idisglobal.com/index/faq/page/165?numIndex=2 (IDIS official FAQ #872 \"What are the RTSP Address URL for each products?\", 2020-05-12)"
      },
      {
        "main": "/trackID={ch}&streamID=1",
        "sub": "/trackID={ch}&streamID=2",
        "third": null,
        "port": null,
        "note": "NVRs: trackID = camera number, streamID = stream quality. Official wording: camera rtsp://ID:password@IP:RTSP port/trackID='Stream number'; NVR/TVR rtsp://.../trackID=<camera-number>&streamID=<stream-number>; default port 554. The FAQ does not say which number is the main stream (1 = main, 2 = sub has no official basis). The YouTube example in the same FAQ uses trackID=1.",
        "source": "https://www.idisglobal.com/index/faq/page/165?numIndex=2 (IDIS official FAQ #872 \"What are the RTSP Address URL for each products?\", 2020-05-12)"
      }
